{
    "_comment": "The test world's deck (API-43) for the conformance fixtures: one road card on the Vale road and one night card at the Crossing Inn, so every draw is known. Dragging the tree aside remembers a deed (API-52), and the night card's fire choice reads it (AGT-91). The tower trail holds four cards that come only while the tree was not cleared (`unless`), so only the draw_three fixture meets them, and the DM picks among those a draw offers (API-53). Not shipped content; the Wend deck is MAP-6.",
    "cards": [
        {
